This is true, however...

> If you wear one of these while eating a monster granting
> poison resistance, you won't die (unless extremely weak or satiated),
> giving you several opportunities to get poison resistance without
> having to use a ring slot.

This sentence gives a false impression about the consequences of
eating a poisonous corpse.  In fact, if you have poison resistance
from any source, you will not be harmed in any way.  If you lack
poison resistance, you will lose HP and strength, but it will never be
an instadeath.

A ring of sustain ability is the poor man's ring of poison
resistance.  Wear it while eating poisonous corpses that might grant
intrinsic poison resistance to avoid the strength loss.  Do not wear
it all the time, or you won't be able to train up your stats.
